<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- Ballast Nedam first-half net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Ballast Nedam first-half net up.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    35    vs  32</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   1.7  vs   1.5</p>
<p>    Cash flow			     75    vs  62</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction group Ballast Nedam NV said it maintained its forecast that 1997 full-year net profit would grow by at least five percent.</p>
<p>The company is 48 percent owned by Germany's Hochtief AG</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    35    vs  35</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     1    vs   2</p>
<p>    Tax					1    vs   2</p>
<p>    Associates' income		   2    vs   1</p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)	   3.46 vs   3.24</p>
<p>    Cash flow/shr (guilders)	   7.48 vs   6.20</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
